Package: tallieR
Title: Import and Score ScoreMe App Questionnaire Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lucas", "França",
           email = "lucas.franca@northumbria.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0853-1319"))
  )
Description: A companion package for the ScoreMe app
    (https://scoreme.circadia-lab.uk). Provides tools to import
    participant JSON exports, re-score validated questionnaires
    (ESS, ISI, DBAS-16, MEQ, PSQI, RU-SATED, STOP-BANG, KSS),
    and assemble tidy wide and long study-level data frames ready
    for downstream analysis in R.
